---
title: Checkout, as the payments team drew it
---
flowchart LR
    %% shoppers come in through the storefront
    shopper([Shopper]) -->|browses| web[Storefront]
    web -->|"POST /orders"| api(Order API)
    subgraph core [Order core]
        api --> orders[(Orders DB)]
    end
    api -. order placed .-> bus[[Event bus]]
    subgraph after [After the order]
        mailer[Mailer]
        stock[Stock service]
    end
    bus -.-> mailer & stock
    api ==>|charges| psp{{Payment provider}}
    classDef external fill:#eee,stroke:#999
    class psp external
    click psp "https://example.com/psp" "The provider's docs"
